      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Please limit the `source_audio` duration to within 1 minute 30 seconds; exceeding this will result in OOM errors.** ChatterBox is likely more appropriate for converting spoken audio than complete songs.\n\nIn my instance, I used **edgetts** to convert the lyrics into TTS and routed the output into **narrator_target**, which to some extent improves the usability of the song conversion results.\n\n**ComfyUI TTS Audio Suite is a powerful AI audio processing suite. Prior to use, ensure your ComfyUI is a clean, dedicated installation rather than an existing production environment, as integrating it may damage your current setup.**"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
